<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-content">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <div class="footer-logo">
          <span class="logo-title">ENGINE SIMULATOR</span>
          <span class="badge badge-intake" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;">v2.0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-desc">
          Professional interactive 3D virtual mechanical engineering laboratory. Designed for mechanical engineering students, BTech/BE programs, diploma students, and technical educators.
        </p>
        <p class="footer-note">
          Engineering accuracy prioritized: continuous crank-slider kinematics, 720° cycle synchronization, and thermodynamic polytropic calculations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Navigation</h4>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="#simulator">3D Interactive Simulator</a></li>
          <li><a href="#stroke-analysis">Real-Time Stroke Analysis</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pv-diagram">Pressure-Volume (P-V) Diagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="#valve-diagram">Valve Timing Diagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="#components">Engine Components Guide</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Engineering Theory</h4>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="#theory">Four-Stroke Working Principle</a></li>
          <li><a href="#kinematics">Crank-Slider Kinematic Formulae</a></li>
          <li><a href="#comparison">Petrol (SI) vs Diesel (CI) Engines</a></li>
          <li><a href="#error-analysis">Ideal Otto Cycle vs Real Losses</a></li>
          <li><a href="#quiz">Interactive Knowledge Quiz</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Technical Assumptions</h4>
        <p class="footer-desc" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">
          Simulation uses single-cylinder 70 mm bore × 60 mm stroke petrol engine geometry (CR 9:1). Indicated pressure-volume modeling uses polytropic gas exponents ($n_c = 1.34, n_e = 1.28$).
        </p>
        <div class="footer-badge-list">
          <span class="badge badge-intake">Astro.js</span>
          <span class="badge badge-compression">Three.js</span>
          <span class="badge badge-power">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="badge badge-exhaust">Vitest</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© 2026 Four-Stroke Engine Simulator. Virtual Mechanical Engineering Laboratory. Built for educational and analytical study.</p>
      <div class="footer-bottom-links">
        <a href="#simulator">Top of Page ↑</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: #060910;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-note {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .footer-heading {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-badge-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .footer-bottom a {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>

